# Normalise line endings so tooling behaves identically on Windows checkouts
# and on Linux CI runners.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` gives Windows working trees CRLF, which
# makes `gofmt -l` report files that are correctly formatted in the repository,
# and would let a CRLF shell script reach the VPS where it fails to execute.
*.go    text eol=lf
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.sql   text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
